data: {"id": "19c8d62db32b495b-thinking-parallel_evidence-603", "run_id": "19c8d62db32b495b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，我先执行首轮 Kubernetes 和可观测性工具，以获取该 Pod 的完整生命周期和崩溃细节。\n\n1. **kubectl_describe**：获取 Pod 状态、Last State、Exit Code 和事件。\n2. **kubectl_previous_logs**：获取上一次崩溃容器的退出日志。\n3. **execute_pod_promql**：获取重启趋势和终止原因。\n4. **query_pod_topology**：获取控制器关系。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789075750763, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

