data: {"id": "19c8d62db32b495b-thinking-parallel_evidence-1886", "run_id": "19c8d62db32b495b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 1. 实体与生命周期\n- Pod: `workload-dff5cbc6b-sjvxl`，Namespace: `aiops-case-07`，UID: `5c278abe-982e-4ea1-9540-d55e1de90b26`\n- 所属控制器: Deployment `workload` -> ReplicaSet `workload-dff5cbc6b`\n- 运行节点: `node2`，Pod IP: `172.16.104.63`\n- 容器: `app`（单容器）\n- 状态: `Status: Running`（当前），但 Kubelet 持续发出 `BackOff` 事件（x242 over 58m），表明 **CrashLoopBackOff 仍在持续**，并非已恢复\n\n## 2. 支持\"应用进程启动失败或配置错误\"的证据\n### 2.1 日志证据（当前 + 上一次崩溃）\n- **当前日志** 和 **previous 日志** 均一致返回相同模式的错误：\n  - `\"event\":\"http_request\", \"level\":\"error\", \"message\":", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789075807225, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

